<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμοργίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stalks of mallow (Malva silvestris),</i> used
			like hemp or flax, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλοπος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					735
				</span></i>
			: acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμοργιν,</span>
			
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμοργίδα</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				737
			</span></i>. (Perh. from the pr. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμοργός</span> as place of growth.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> proparox. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμοργις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμόργη</span>
			, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.87
			</span></i>.</div>
